breaking_changes.Adaptation_method:
Replace `headers.getAll('set-cookie')` with `Object.entries(response.headers.raw())` to correctly access all `Set-Cookie` header values as an array. Example:
```js
if (res.headers.has('set-cookie')) {
  for (const [key, values] of Object.entries(res.headers.raw())) {
    if (key.toLowerCase() === 'set-cookie') {
      for (const value of values) {
        // Process each Set-Cookie header value
        await cookieJar.setCookie(value, url);
      }
    }
  }
}
```
